 **Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
 
+### Specialty directory
+
+<a id="req-vet-003"></a>
+
+The veterinarian directory answers which specialties a veterinarian holds. Staff also ask the inverse: which veterinarians hold a given specialty. A read-only page answers it. It lists every specialty the clinic knows by its stored name, each with the veterinarians holding it. Every veterinarian is shown by full name, given name before family name. Every specialty renders on one page, without pagination. A veterinarian holding no specialty does not appear: the page lists specialties, not the full veterinarian roster `[REQ-VET-003]`.
+
+**Done when:**
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given the clinic's specialties, when the specialty directory is opened, then every specialty is listed by its stored name, each with the veterinarians holding it.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given the specialty directory, when it is opened, then every specialty renders on a single page with no pagination.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a veterinarian holding a specialty, when the specialty directory is opened, then that veterinarian is shown by full name, given name before family name (for example "Helen Leary").
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a veterinarian holding no specialty, when the specialty directory is opened, then that veterinarian does not appear on the page.
+
+**Edge cases:**
+1. A specialty held by no veterinarian still appears, shown with no veterinarians under it.
+
+**Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
+
 ### Language
 
